# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers. A CRLF line ending makes the
# shebang unusable - the kernel looks for an interpreter literally named
# "/bin/sh" and the container fails with a bare "not found". Git on
# Windows will happily convert them on checkout unless told otherwise.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Same reasoning: these are read by tools in Linux containers.
*.sql text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
